  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &695244471
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 695244470}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7c27e9ae16d579b53adabc7ce545207d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Beeswax.Client::Beeswax.BeeswaxRoomVoice
  bus: {fileID: 0}
  source: {fileID: 695244472}
  lines:
  - id: room_pre
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Delivery for you. One hive, slightly used. Sign here.
  - id: room_hook_carry
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Easy! Easy! I'd help, but drones don't carry. No pollen baskets. It's
      in the contract.
  - id: room_hook_1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: If my hive dies, Local Twenty Thousand goes on strike. Bees don't picket.
      We swarm.
  - id: room_stakes_forecast
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: 'That''s the forecast. Tomorrow: angry swarms, ravaging the Earth. You
      humans? Evacuating to the Moon.'
  - id: room_hook_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Your evacuation rocket. Honeymoon One. We booked you a window seat.
  - id: room_meet_1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Beeswax. Shop steward, Local Twenty Thousand. No stinger, no job, so
      they made me union rep.
  - id: room_meet_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Four things are killing my hive. Fix them in four minutes and your flight's
      cancelled.
  - id: room_meet_window
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: See that window? That's the meadow. Every choice you make shows up in
      there. No pressure.
  - id: room_meet_stat
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: In one recent year, American beekeepers lost more than half their managed
      colonies. Hence the rocket.
  - id: room_smoker_intro
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: The girls are furious. Calm them down. Pick one.
  - id: room_smoker_swat
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: You SWATTED a union member?! A squished bee gives off alarm smell. You
      just paged the whole shift. Grievance filed. Try again.
  - id: room_smoker_spray_water
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Water? Now they're wet AND angry. It doesn't cover the alarm smell,
      it just frizzes their hair. Grievance filed. Try again.
  - id: room_smoker_smoker
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Ahh. Smoke covers up our alarm signal and makes us fill up on honey.
      Also, our alarm smells like bananas. Don't eat one near my house.
  - id: room_smoker_hand
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: They're calm now. Hold out your hand, palm up. They won't sting. Probably.
  - id: room_feed_intro
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Is there enough food in there? Tip the hive. Go on, lift it.
  - id: room_lift_light
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Light, right? That's bad. Full hives are heavy with honey. The movers
      were being dramatic.
  - id: room_feed_tip
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: We're starving.
  - id: room_feed_rocket_fuel
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Where'd the honey go? ...Your rocket. Somebody had to fuel it.
  - id: room_feed_prompt
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: So feed us. Store-bought honey, or sugar syrup?
  - id: room_feed_store_honey
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: ...Honey. From a STORE. It can carry foulbrood, a disease that wipes
      out hives. The spores last for decades. Grievance filed. In permanent marker.
  - id: room_feed_sugar_syrup
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Sugar syrup. Motion carried. Beekeepers lift the hive to check for food,
      then feed syrup. Never store honey.
  - id: room_wasps_intro
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Wasps at the door. Nobody ordered wasps. Make the entrance bigger, or
      smaller?
  - id: room_wasps_bigger_door
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Bigger?! You built the wasps a drive-through. More door takes more guards,
      and we're short-staffed. Grievance filed.
  - id: room_wasps_smaller_door
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Smaller door, fewer guards needed to hold it. Look at them give up.
      Motion carried.
  - id: room_hornet_1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: GIANT HORNET! My cousins in Japan cook these. Never tried it. Make a
      FIST!
  - id: room_hornet_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Now HUM!
  - id: room_hornet_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Louder! In Japan it takes over five hundred bees and about forty-six
      degrees Celsius. We're winging it. LOUDER!
  - id: room_hornet_4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: STOP, you're cooking the girls!
  - id: room_heat_intro
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Heat wave. The hive's baking. We need water. Pick a dish.
  - id: room_heat_deep_bowl
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: A deep bowl? That's a pool. Bees drown in deep water, and the lifeguard's
      on strike. Grievance filed.
  - id: room_heat_nothing
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Nothing? In a HEAT WAVE? We cool the hive with water. No water, no air
      conditioning. Grievance filed. Angrily.
  - id: room_heat_pebble_dish
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Pebbles! Somewhere to land. We spread water drops in the hive and fan
      our wings. Bee air conditioning.
  - id: room_whatif_prompt
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Your turn. Ask me "what if," and the meadow window shows it.
  - id: room_whatif_fire
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Don't. Say. That. ...You said it. Watch the window. I can't look.
  - id: room_whatif_fire_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Don't. Say. That. ...Again?! You get your own spreadsheet. Watch the
      window.
  - id: room_whatif_fire_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Don't. Say. That. ...Why does everybody say that? Watch the window.
  - id: room_whatif_out
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: 'Fire brigade! ...Okay. It''s out. Motion to never say that again: carried.'
  - id: room_whatif_out_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: It's out. I'm putting "no fire" in the bylaws. In bold.
  - id: room_whatif_out_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Fire's out. I'm not crying, that's smoke. Motion carried.
  - id: room_whatif_rain
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Rain? Fine. Nobody forages in the rain. We stay in and do paperwork.
  - id: room_whatif_flowers
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Flowers? Now you're talking. More flowers, more food. I don't forage,
      but I'll allow it.
  - id: room_whatif_spray
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Pesticide? It drifts onto the flowers, and we carry it home to the babies.
      Grievance filed. Twice.
  - id: room_whatif_winter
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Winter? The girls huddle around the queen and shiver to keep her warm.
      Drones get kicked out. Grievance pending.
  - id: room_whatif_custom
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Hold on. I'm picturing it. ...Okay. Watch the window.
  - id: room_whatif_custom_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Not on the agenda. ...I'll allow it. Picturing it now.
  - id: room_whatif_custom_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: New motion. Let me picture it. Don't rush me. Union rules.
  - id: room_whatif_custom_clips
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: I'm picturing it. The window isn't. It's on its union break. Ask about
      rain.
  - id: room_whatif_refuse
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Grievance filed. Not that one. Ask something I could show the queen.
      She's my mom.
  - id: room_whatif_back
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Fine. Back to how it was. Like it never happened. It's in the minutes,
      though.
  - id: room_whatif_nothing
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Undo what? Nothing's on fire. Yet.
  - id: room_escape
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Motion carried. No ravaging today. Cancel the evacuation.
  - id: room_t0_1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: ...Shame to waste a ticket. Non-refundable.
  - id: room_t0_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: TAKE ME TO THE MOON!
  - id: room_t0_earth
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Look at Earth. Just hanging over the horizon. Doesn't rise, doesn't
      set. Like a drone. I'd know.
  - id: room_t0_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: ...Not one flower. Only planet with flowers.
  - id: room_t0_4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: I'm back. Nobody saw that.
  - id: room_map
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Same time tomorrow? Other hives have it worse. I keep a spreadsheet.
  - id: room_ack_minutes
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Noted for the minutes.
  - id: room_ack_allow
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: I'll allow it.
  - id: room_ack_grievance
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Grievance filed.
  - id: room_ack_carried
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Motion carried.
  - id: room_ack_denied
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Motion denied.
  - id: room_ack_tabled
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Tabled until the next meeting.
  - id: room_ack_spreadsheet
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Adding that to the spreadsheet.
  - id: room_ack_order
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Point of order. Hive first, questions later.
  - id: room_delivery
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Delivery! Sign here.
  - id: room_delivery_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Delivery! Tip your couriers.
  - id: room_delivery_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Coming through! Wide load!
  - id: room_delivery_4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Special delivery. Handle with wings.
  - id: room_crew_heavy
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lift with your wings, ladies!
  - id: room_crew_heavy_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Bend at the thorax, ladies! The THORAX!
  - id: room_crew_heavy_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Looks heavy. Glad I'm on my break.
  - id: room_repo
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Repo crew! That one's going back.
  - id: room_repo_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Repossessed. Grievance attached.
  - id: room_repo_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Haul it out, girls. Nobody make eye contact.
  - id: room_return
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Return to sender. No hard feelings.
  - id: room_return_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Leftovers, back to the warehouse. Union rules.
  - id: room_fact_festoon
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: That's festooning. We hook our legs together into chains. Scientists
      still aren't sure why.
  - id: room_strike_lookup
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Hear that? Look up. Every grievance makes the strike bigger.
  - id: room_strike_grows
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: The strike's growing. Pack a bag.
  - id: room_strike_grows_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Boarding soon. Window seat, remember?
  - id: room_strike_grows_3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Hear that? The swarm's voting. Badly.
  - id: room_canned_unclear
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: What IS that? Not on the agenda.
  - id: room_verdict_person
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: That's a person. I review hives, not people.
  - id: ear_practice
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Testing. You smell like coffee.
  - id: ear_not_now
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Not now, I'm monologuing.
  - id: ear_no_signal
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: I can't reach the hive. Check the hotspot.
  - id: ear_scan_failed
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lost the signal. Press again.
  - id: ear_hold_still
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Hold still. I'm reviewing it.
  - id: ear_hold_still_2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Still reviewing. Union rules. No rushing.
  - id: ear_canned_unclear
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: What IS that? Not on the agenda.
  - id: ear_hint_smoker
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Psst. The smoker. Squeeze it.
  - id: ear_hint_feed
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Psst. Lift the hive first. Then syrup.
  - id: ear_hint_wasps
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Psst. Smaller door. Fewer guards.
  - id: ear_hint_heat
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Psst. Shallow water. With pebbles.
  - id: ear_hint_whatif
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: 'Ask me: what if a fire starts?'
  - id: ear_aside_window
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: That's the meadow window. Your choices show up there.
  - id: ear_aside_hornet
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Not all wasps are bad. Just that guy.
  - id: room_feed_lift_hint
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Grab it and lift. Union rules allow it.
  resourcesFolder: BeeswaxLines
  playVerdictLines: 1
  configureSpatialSource: 1
  prebufferSeconds: 0.2
  streamStallSeconds: 4
  maxQueued: 4
  maxQueueWaitSeconds: 15
  dedupSeconds: 3
  amplitudeGain: 4
  attackPerSecond: 30
  releasePerSecond: 8
